<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT-Singer Thai rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Singer Thai rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seamico Securities said on Friday it rated shares of Singer Thailand Plc a buy due to lower costs and a healthy sales outlook.</p>
<p>Singer's consolidated net profit for the year to June 30 rose four percent to 643 million baht over the previous year, Seamico noted in its research report.</p>
</text>
